      en: ["The monument stands exactly 66 meters tall", "Manuel L. Quezon was the first president of the Philippine Commonwealth", "The three pylons symbolize Luzon, Visayas, and Mindanao", "Federico Ilustre was the lead architect of the shrine", "The mausoleum contains the remains of Manuel and Aurora Quezon", "The structure was officially completed and inaugurated in 1978"],
